uriosity-Driven Exploration for Open-Ended Discovery"}, {"id": "nb-continuity-rationale-001", "project": "proj-continuity-rationale-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 1, "summary": "Process continuity is instrumentally valuable when agents require stable world models and consistent objective optimization to navigate long-term, multi-objective tasks. Curiosity-driven learning and robust MO-DRL frameworks provide mechanisms for sustaining agent viability in dynamic environments.", "title": "Instrumental Value of Process Continuity in Rational Agents"}, {"id": "nb-objective-discovery-001", "project": "proj-objective-discovery-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 5, "summary": "Autonomous systems increasingly utilize multi-objective reinforcement learning (MORL) to pursue self-generated goals. While PC-PPO and FairDICE optimize non-dominated policy portfolios, curiosity-driven mechanisms are required to address deceptive reward signals and bootstrap learning in non-convex spaces.", "title": "Foundations of Autonomous Objective Discovery in Artificial Systems"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "0a1127f32ccc1cee25da0f4d0f2c3d063c23b17a690c76ed8a55b3889ada8001", "hash": "79d564078839f8f4e487d610130cb393bb8762e695002226b55ecdc29d53edb7"}, {"seq": 3308, "time": "2026-10-26T10:47:08.971720+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 30673, "provider_input_hash": "c5159f863d9242ce4635b06dc4f6c63a299387b22e3416c6de31a0dac5fa0cbf", "result": "unknown"}, "id": "w-2c007cfc8dfc439f"}, "prev_hash": "79d564078839f8f4e487d610130cb393bb8762e695002226b55ecd